# PowerShell Administration Toolkit

A practical, enterprise-friendly module for server and workstation administration tasks.

## Project details

- Module name: PowerShellAdministrationToolkit
- Root module: `src/PowerShellAdministrationToolkit.psm1`
- PowerShell versions: 5.1 and later

## Exported functions

- `Get-ComputerInventory`
- `Get-RecentWindowsEvents`
- `Get-ServicesHealth`
- `Invoke-AdminAudit`
- `Test-NetworkPath`
